<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (This project focuses on classifying reviews and generating interactive blog posts based on real product reviews on the Amazon platform. The goal of the project is to build a machine learning model capable of classifying sentiments \(positive, neutral, negative\) for each review, as well as clustering reviews into categories and generating blog post texts based on the analysis.)
/E (This project focuses on classifying reviews and generating interactive blog posts based on real product reviews on the Amazon platform. The goal of the project is to build a machine learning model capable of classifying sentiments \(positive, neutral, negative\) for each review, as well as clustering reviews into categories and generating blog post texts based on the analysis.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [1]
>>
